      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Citizen McCain is back with another episode this afternoon with our friend Mo Kelly and the lovely @RCamposDuffy \n\nJoin us LIVE at 12pm ET! piped.video/ugIlB6Cdneg",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2053833534930858077",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T13:44:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My friend @clayaiken\u2019s brand NEW single \u201cRewind\u201d comes out tomorrow!! Let me tell you - the kids and I have been bouncing and singing it for weeks! It\u2019s a FANTASTIC summer pop song. \n\nMake sure to get it tomorrow and watching him perform it on the @AmericanIdol finale tonight!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2053550799641313689",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-10T19:00:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Imagine how desperate and humbled the person was who dm'd him asking for help because they lost their job. \n\nWhy are people so cruel? What is the point of this video other than to embarrass this person. Do influencers like this ever interact with actual real people?\n\n\nrichlux713 (@RichLux713)\n\nTHE FULL JAMES CHARLES DELETED VIDEO\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/RichLux713/status/2052945532977344842#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2053104676321558563",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T13:27:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "HAHAHAHA\n\n\nMediaite (@Mediaite)\n\nMegyn Kelly Falsely Claims Ben Shapiro's Videos 'Have Like 500 Views' One Day After He Put Up Over 500,000 \u2014 7x More Than She Did  mediaite.com/media/news/megy\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Mediaite/status/2052758860792844474#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2052761093177520428",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T14:42:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "HELL YESSSS!! \n\nSUCK IT SPANBERGER!\n\n\nEric Daugherty (@EricLDaugh)\n\n\ud83d\udea8 BREAKING: VIRGINIA DEMOCRAT GERRYMANDERING MAP OFFICIALLY DEAD\n\nThe State Supreme Court has *STRUCK DOWN* the Democrats' map that would've left only 1 GOP Congressional seat.\n\nVirginia will remain a 6D-5R Congressional state.\n\nLET'S GO!!!!!! \ud83d\udd25\n\nHuge backfire. Now the SOUTH can keep redrawing. WE WIN!\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/EricLDaugh/status/2052752956458455408#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2052759350670770182",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T14:35:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I hate all gerrymandering and it should be illegal. \n\nFull stop - it's awful when democrats do it, it's awful when republicans do it. American citizens have their voices and representation robbed of them.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2052553032827535633",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T00:55:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is not hyperbole - @spencerpratt is the blueprint for how my generation of older millennials needs to communicate and present their ideas and campaign messaging when running for office.\n\nHe is 10/10 no notes. Absolute raw talent. Killed the debate.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2052204490946707905",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T01:50:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "ELECT @spencerpratt MAYOR!!!! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2052197861794705789",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T01:24:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
